ppt-sdk

ppt-sdk.es.js is built internally in this repository. It is distributed under
the repository's primary license (ISC, as declared by the "license" field in
plugins/whiteboard/package.json); no separate license terms apply to it.

Third-party material bundled in ppt-sdk.es.js:
- JSZip 3.10.1: dual-licensed under MIT or GPLv3. Its notice is preserved in
  the bundle header; full text:
  https://github.com/Stuk/jszip/blob/main/LICENSE.markdown
- pako (a JSZip dependency): MIT,
  https://github.com/nodeca/pako/blob/main/LICENSE

Fonts in fonts/:
- NotoSansMonoCJKsc-ASCII.woff2 and NotoSansMonoCJKsc-Bold-ASCII.woff2 are
  ASCII subsets of Noto Sans Mono CJK SC, distributed under the SIL Open Font
  License 1.1. See fonts/OFL.txt.

pdf.js 5.7.284 static assets (including the Liberation Sans standard fonts)
are shipped separately under assets/whiteboard/pdfjs-5.7.284/, together with
their own license files.
